<title>USA: Digital Biometrics debentures converted.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics debentures converted.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc, a maker of identification systems, said Monday that all of its outstanding eight percent convertible debentures due September 29, 1998, have been converted to common stock of the company.</p>
</text>
